{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BSQFZshHAn1795420461.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔昌運中心高級資深分區營業經理招權峰表示，近日市況持續向好，大埔居屋新興花園最新錄2座中層A室，單位實用面積591平方呎，3房間隔，日前議價後以居二市場價465萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約7,868元。</p><p><br/>據了解，新買家為綠表客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定購入單位自用。據了解，原業主於1986年以萬元28.6購入上址，持貨約40年，現轉手賬面獲利436.4萬元離場，單位期內升值15倍多。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.951381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T19:37:39.104012+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:17.112082+00:00","content_hash":"f49e09bc3520e6866a977bec9b38b6899278a62f3698ac14b7294752028863d9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}